'''Aether Foundation''' (Japanese: '''エーテルざいだん''' ''Aether Foundation'') is a {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} introduced in [[Generation VII]]. They are [[Pokémon Trainer]]s who work for the [[Aether Foundation]].

Most Aether Foundation Trainers are white-uniformed "[[Aether Foundation Employee|Employees]]", appearing in the main storyline at [[Aether Paradise]] in a villainous role, similar to the [[Grunt]]s of [[villainous team]]s. Masked scientist Employees are battled in the Foundation's secret lab. Most Employees keep their Pokémon in [[Great Ball]]s, while scientist Employees use [[Repeat Ball]]s.

Outside of the main storyline, Employees battled at the [[Battle Tree]] and [[Battle Royal Dome]] have distinct names and are friendlier. The Trainers at the Battle Royal Dome exclusively use {{t|Water}}- and {{type|Grass}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}.

[[Faba]] also uses this Trainer class in most of his post-game battles. He is a known {{type|Psychic}} specialist.

